= The Death of Thaddeus Stevens

News has been announced from the home of well respected congressmen Stevens of his tragic passing due to chronic stomach ailments and dropsy. His actions will never be forgetten among all Americans for the advancement of all citizens of the republic no matter of race and previous conditions of servitude. Shortly before he died after learning his soon to be resting place would reside in a whites-only cemetery he promptly moved his resting place to Lancaster with no racial restrictions. Many leading figures of the Republican Party arrive to pay there respect from such as Sumner, Trumbull, Cameron, and other dignitares of all kinds.

His death is mourned by the Freemen population and the <span style="color: #7A1F5C;">**Radical Republicans**</span>. Meanwhile Democrats at the New York World egregiously claim he is the "author of more evil and mischief than any other inhabitant of the globe since the end of the Civil War". Despite the Democrats actions to discredit his legacy, hopefully he will be remembers for his actions.

{!<figure>!}
  {!<blockquote cite="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thaddeus_Stevens">!}
    {!<p>!}
      I repose in this quiet and secluded spot<br>
      Not from any natural preference for solitude<br>
      But, finding other Cemeteries limited as to Race<br>
      by Charter Rules<br>
      I have chosen this that I might illustrate<br>
      in my death<br>
      The Principles which I advocated<br>
      through a long life;<br>
      EQUALITY OF MAN BEFORE HIS CREATOR
    {!</p>!}
  {!</blockquote>!}
  {!<figcaption>— Epitaph of <cite>Thaddeus Stevens</cite></figcaption>!}
{!</figure>!}

